proposed_comments.body:
### Do not mark browser preview disposed from the finalizer path

**Severity:** `high`

The finalizer calls `Dispose(false)`, but the current guard still sets `disposed = true` even when `disposing` is false. Keep the finalizer path side-effect free so only explicit disposal performs the filesystem cleanup and records the object as disposed.

```suggestion
protected virtual void Dispose(bool disposing)
{
    if (!disposed && disposing)
    {
        Microsoft.PowerToys.FilePreviewCommon.Helper.CleanupTempDir(TempFolderPath.Path);
        disposed = true;
    }
}
```

